// _knownglobalsymbols: a short array of symbols naming NewtApp and other protos,
// spelt with oddly restored capitals (ProToadDressPicker is protoAddressPicker,
// NewTabOutView newtAboutView, ...; docs/curiosities.md).  It is reachable as the
// R-constant R_knownglobalsymbols, but nothing in the C code reads it.  Symbols
// compare without regard to case, so the spelling is harmless.

_knownglobalsymbols := [|Array|:
	'ProtoNewsHowBar,
	'ProToyEarPicker,
	'NewTabOutView,
	'ProtoValidAteSlip,
	'NewTinFoBox,
	'NewTinFoButton,
	'NewTrollEntryView,
	'NewTrollLayout,
	'NewTrollOverLayout,
	'NewTenTryView,
	'ProToadDressPicker
];
